  "_description": "Innovo curated Apple TV app catalog with per-icon SHA-256.",
  "_changelog": [
    "2026-05-23.1: Initial seed from atv-bridge static catalog v2 (69 apps)",
    "2026-05-23.2: Updated Spotify + HBO Max to current App Store artwork. Added 16 previously-missing icons via iTunes Search API: Movies Anywhere, MUBI, The Roku Channel (Roku app icon), YouTube Music, NHL, Xbox, Steam Link, VLC, Infuse, Jellyfin (Swiftfin), Peloton, FITE (TrillerTV), WWE Network, UFC, Vimeo, MasterClass. Crackle + GeForce NOW remain icon=null (no current App Store match).",
    "2026-05-23.3: Added Crackle (icon-icons.com) and GeForce NOW (Wikimedia, SVG rasterized to 512x512). All 69 apps now have icons.",
    "2026-05-23.4: Replaced HBO Max icon with operator-supplied version.",
    "2026-05-23.5: Standardized ALL icons to 256x256 (per slug+size spec). Added 4 channels: Chillio (IPTV player), Hallmark Channel, NASA, Spectrum TV. Replaced GeForce NOW with operator-supplied artwork. Replaced HBO Max with operator-supplied artwork. Naming convention: lowercase, strip special characters and spaces, .png extension."
